    <section class="phase-section">
        <h2>Observation Requiring Review</h2>

        <div class="bug-grid">

            <div class="bug-card">
                <div class="bug-header">
                    <h3>Mobile Number Validation</h3>
                    <span class="status fixed">REVIEW</span>
                </div>

                <p><strong>Test Case:</strong> TC-REG-002</p>
                <p><strong>Feature:</strong> User Registration</p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Observation:</strong>
                    The mobile number field accepted
                    alphabetic characters along with digits.
                    Account creation was successful.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Impact:</strong>
                    The input may require additional
                    validation depending on the application's
                    business requirements.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Conclusion:</strong>
                    This is a potential validation issue,
                    not a confirmed software defect,
                    because the field requirements
                    have not been verified.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bug-card">
                <div class="bug-header">
                    <h3>Limited Test Coverage</h3>
                    <span class="status fixed">PASS - Limited</span>
                </div>

                <p><strong>Test Case:</strong> TC-REG-001</p>
                <p><strong>Feature:</strong> User Registration</p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Observation:</strong>
                    Required-field validation was observed
                    for one field.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Limitation:</strong>
                    The exact field and validation message
                    were not recorded.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Conclusion:</strong>
                    The observed behavior passed,
                    but the test does not demonstrate
                    complete validation coverage.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

